<%# One episode card of a product page -- the customer page and the admin preview render the same card so the preview
    shows what a customer sees (handoff 0066). Only the link target differs, and the admin preview adds the episode's
    number and status before the title and says "편집하기 →" instead of "학습 시작 →", because its link opens the admin
    edit page. The customer card shows no episode number at all -- position is an ordering key (it can be 0), not
    something a visitor needs to read; the URL still uses display_id. The customer CTA is fixed text: there is no
    per-episode progress to vary it by.

    Handoff 0067 -- (admin: number + status,) title and CTA sit on one row (the number and CTA never shrink or wrap;
    only the title does, via truncate + a title tooltip, same as before). Below `sm` the CTA alone drops to its own
    line (`w-full` forces the wrap; `sm:w-auto` plus `sm:ml-auto` puts it back at the right end of the row). The
    number span is omitted entirely on the customer card rather than left empty, so the row's gap doesn't push the
    title right. No per-episode state (e.g. a lock icon) exists on this card today.

    Handoff 0070 -- an optional one-line teaser (episode.summary) as a second line, plain text, truncated to one
    line with a title tooltip for the full text when it's cut off (same convention as the title above); skipped
    entirely when blank. %>
<% admin = local_assigns.fetch(:admin, false) %>
<% title = episode.customer_title.presence || "(제목 없음)" %>
<%= link_to path, class: "block rounded-xl border border-gray-200 p-4 hover:border-blue-300" do %>
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1">
    <% if admin %><span class="shrink-0 text-xs font-semibold text-gray-400"><%= episode.display_id %> · <%= episode.status %></span><% end %>
    <span class="min-w-0 flex-1 truncate font-bold text-gray-900" title="<%= title %>"><%= title %></span>
    <span class="order-last w-full shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-semibold text-blue-600 sm:order-none sm:ml-auto sm:w-auto"><%= admin ? "편집하기 →" : "학습 시작 →" %></span>
  </div>
  <% if episode.summary.present? %>
    <p class="mt-1 truncate text-sm text-gray-500" title="<%= episode.summary %>"><%= episode.summary %></p>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
